    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4acefccb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一种通过燃烧特定矿物所产生的特殊火焰，其形态更接近纯粹的光，而非寻常之火。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f4cddac2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "引火所用矿物的种类及配比为谕女们代代相传的秘要，从未为外人所知。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ecb64d0e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "圣火本身并无特异效用，谕女们仅以之为媒，借由自身共鸣力于焰光中窥见未来，写下预言。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_711effc3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "然而在谕女们的观念中，圣火并非只是占卜的介质，其更被视为“落入尘世的日月星辉”，因而一般被称为“焰光”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    }
  ]
